[test-harness setup note]
One initial browser receipt attempt returned HTTP 403 because the isolated Vite origin was not in the local CSRF trusted-origin setting. No receipt or movement was created by that request. After correcting only the test-server setting, the same form submission succeeded (HTTP 201); it did not create a duplicate receipt.
